      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Warner%2C_South_Dakota"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Growth in Warner was primarily fueled by the expansion of the Chicago, Milwaukee, St. Paul and Pacific Railroad.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
